{
  "Name": "Nuance PDF Reader v6.0 Launch Stack Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack buffer overflow in Nuance PDF Reader v6.0. The vulnerability is triggered when opening a malformed PDF file that contains an overly long string in a /Launch field. This results in overwriting a structured exception handler record. This exploit does not use javascript.",
